OL,3,GNEWSAWhy parking charges are going
OL,4,Aahead at Lickey Hills
OL,5,
OL,6,FParking charges are set to be
OL,7,Fintroduced at Lickey Hills Country Park
OL,8,Fdespite Birmingham City Council putting
OL,9,Fsimilar proposals for two other parks
OL,10,Fon hold.
OL,12,FThe authority originally planned to
OL,13,Fintroduce charges at Lickey Hills,
OL,14,Fwhich sits on the border with
OL,15,FWorcestershire, as well as Sutton Park
OL,16,Fand Sheldon Country Park as it looked
OL,17,Ffor ways to generate income amid
OL,18,Fongoing financial pressures.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
