OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy parking charges are going
OL,4,Aahead at Lickey Hills
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, officials have since decided
OL,7,Fto review proposals affecting Sutton
OL,8,FPark and Sheldon Country Park after
OL,9,Freconsidering the "individual
OL,10,Fcircumstances" of each site.
OL,12,FBirmingham City Council said it had a
OL,13,F"responsibility to manage its finances
OL,14,Fresponsibly while protecting valued
OL,15,Fpublic assets".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
